              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngase ngizwa izwi elikhulu liphuma ethempelini, lithi kuzo izingelosi eziyisikhombisa: “Hambani nithululele emhlabeni izitsha zolaka lukaNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
